From 7fc330415067470783c9b7fb8db22396af6b30d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tong <zhengtong0611@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:25:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] Verdict dances: Victory with music, Default Dance on a
 draw

VerdictDanceCli entries can now take --audio <file> (the dance's music,
instead of the silent track) and --clip <project .anim> (a humanoid clip
already in the project) as well as --fbx. Victory is rebuilt with a song so
the winner's bot dances to it, and the draw dance is now 'Default Dance',
Mate Engine's own PET_DANCING animation. The launcher and the mock default
to it; the README documents both options and the credits.
